  "accepted_answers": [
    "Viu",
    "Biu Kingdom",
    "Biu federation"
  ],
  "explanation": "The sources explicitly identify three distinct historical names or designations for Biu: 1) 'Viu' is stated as the initial name in D1S2 and D2S3 ('The name of Biu was initially called Viu'). 2) 'Biu Kingdom' is the designation used prior to 1920 according to D6S2. 3) 'Biu federation' is the name adopted after 1957 as per D1S5. Other candidates like 'Ziu', 'Bijjou', etc., are either incidental variations found in a list of unrelated names (D5S1) or explicitly noted as modifications/replacements in the text (D4S3), and thus do not represent valid historical names of Biu itself."
}
